# Coach admin

Optimise for scanning and actions, not marketing cards. A coach should see the current anchor, what is pending, and the next programme action without opening a modal first.

View-as-Athlete stays read-only. Preview routes live under `/admin/hyrox-athletes/{id}/preview`.

Copy Week, Auto-Carry, and Block 4+ behaviour stay intact. Do not clamp block numbers back to 4.

The coach decides the active benchmark and the published target. Athlete submissions wait for approval. Internal notes stay on coach surfaces.
